{"route":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/indian-pharmacopoeia-2018-and-its-addenda/8-category-en/250-road-map-for-indian-pharmacopoeia-2018","kind":"article","crumbs":[{"label":"Products & Services"},{"label":"Indian Pharmacopoeia (IP)","href":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia"},{"label":"Indian Pharmacopoeia 2018 and its Addenda","href":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/indian-pharmacopoeia-2018-and-its-addenda"},{"label":"Road Map for Indian Pharmacopoeia 2018"}],"updated":"2019-01-02","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B6/%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AF-%E0%A4%AB%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE-%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%88%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%80/%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AF-%E0%A4%AD%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B7%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BE-2018-%E0%A4%94%E0%A4%B0-%E0%A4%87%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87-%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B7.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/indian-pharmacopoeia-2018-and-its-addenda/8-category-en/250-road-map-for-indian-pharmacopoeia-2018.html","title":"Road Map for Indian Pharmacopoeia 2018","bodyHtml":"<p><strong>Working Time Schedule for IP-2018 Edition</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Preparation of list of new monographs/revised tests</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>–</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Upto Dec., 2015</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Drafting of new monographs</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>–</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Upto June, 2016</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Verification of Monographs</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>–</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Upto Aug., 2016</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Preparation of IR spectra’s, Structures, Nomenclature, Category, Dose, Usual strengths, Solubilities, Reagents and Solutions etc. </p>\n</td>\